step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Thormac</col> on the top floor of the <col=800000>Sorcerer's Tower</col> south of <col=800000>Seers' Village</col>. (BLR)</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Thormac on the top floor of the Sorcerer's Tower south of Seers' Village. (BLR)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to Seers Village and speak to a <col=800000>Seer</col>. (Wait until the seer is done checking himself in the mirror.) Be sure not to skip this step, as the scorpion in Taverley Dungeon is not accessible without first speaking to the seer.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Thormac on the top floor of the Sorcerer's Tower south of Seers' Village. (BLR)</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Seers Village and speak to a Seer. (Wait until the seer is done checking himself in the mirror.) Be sure not to skip this step, as the scorpion in Taverley Dungeon is not accessible without first speaking to the seer.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Scorpions can be caught in any order and there is no need to return between each catch.</col>
